        "sid": "EZR 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy qoomár Esra iwa firiirin nee iwa hhu'uu'un, iwa /a/aamin nee giti ngiwa yaamúr óh dír geeraá doó Mungú, kuri i burumburiít nee boo/oó yaariír oo múk Israeli, hhawaate, nee /ameena, nee na/ii, inooín tari ló' wa /aa/amín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam Shekania garmoó Yehieli oo wák baraá na/aá Elamuwo, Esra guri báy, «Atén Munguúrén una sadakuusaán, /ameenár xoordaá hatlá' awa yaamuuká' kari duxuutaán. Ala tam adoorihe harahhifo i deer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, alqado a tleehhaán nee Munguúrén, atén tlaawayrén u geexawaán tam nee na/ii'ín kudá' naa laqwaalii'i, ar adoodá' kuúng nee mukdá' hara'ayár Munguúrén ngi da'ayumiitá' kar kata'. Kaangwí i tleehharuuti ar dabe kawa eehaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlawáng, gadiyeérí i kuúng sa hariín, atén a dinkwa nee kuúng, muuna hhe'eés, gadiyeé tleehheek.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Esra iri tláy kaahamuusér uren nee múk tlahhoó Laáwiwo nee múk Israeli sleémeero giri lo'ór /aymiís adoorí ngiwa tleehhiya'. Inooín lo'o ngiri /ayiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Esra iri tláy dír geeraá Doó Mungú wa alé, iri dáh baraá kutuwír doó Yehohanani garmoó Eliashibu, iri amoodí qaát mikaáte gaa /ayiiká tam ma'aay gaa wahiiká as gurhaami, asma ina /aa/amín as dakuúsár mukdá' naa baraá looháy wa waatl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afo kari ilahariís baraá Yuda sleémeero nee Yerusalemuro, amór mukdá' sleémeero naa baraá looháy wa waatl tawa burumburiiti baraá yaamaá Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee barnaxes hee naa daqayká baraá deeloorí tame, ar adoodá' hara'aya geeraharuuse nee bariise ngira oi, daqaari'iimarós sleémeero kan hayoh, inós kilós kuri baynitis dír dinkwár mukdá' naa baraá looháy wa watli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo hhawaate sleémeero awa Yuda nee awa Benyamini tari burumburiít har afiqoomár deelo tame, bál slahhángw gwaleél tawa mibeeri tsár. Muu sleémeero iri iwiít dír afeenír doó Mungú, ta daraax as kaangwí nee as tluwoó ur oo tluúw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy, kaahamusmo Esra iri sihhiít, giri báy, «Aga dakusé', /ameenár xoordaá hatlá' kawa duxuté', gawaá adoorihe dakuúsár Israeli aga dogé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám daxta, tlakweemaahúng hhu'uu'umaak dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'iihúng, nee sla'aarirós na tleehhaak, ti partle' dír múk yaamuukae, slám /ameenaadár xoordaá hatlá' guusaak.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinku'uumadá' iri ilaawáts, tari oó' ar afór ur, «I qoón! Adór kangwrén kura ó' an adór atén wa hariim tlehhmuuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukwí ku yaariír, slám a qoomár tluwoó yaariír, atén sihhtanór tsee/a a aleeslawaanaaká, slamí gadiyeérí ar looár wakeeká, laqaá ar deelo tsareeká, asma aga ló'wa dakuusaán baraá kangwsinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala geeraharuuseerén i met baraakaá Yerusalemu as daanduú muu sleémeero as kaangwí kuwa axweesi daqaní muu sleémeero baraá gixsaduurene, kudá' /ameenár xoordaá hatlá' gaa duxuut, ni hardihiye' afi qoomaadá' taa qaasi, slamí dinkwa nee bariisér umuúqo gixsa nee har'ohuuseero, ay dír buhhtaá xaraaslá' awa Munguúrén ni tsauya', kaangwí i faaki.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé axweesantí gaa sii' i kaahh ala aqo har Yonatan garmoó Asaheli, nee Yaseya, garmoó Tikwa kilooín nina sihhiitiyé' /aymuuwí ngway si'iyé', Meshulamu nee Shabetai heé Laáwi tari bartá mukwí áy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy mukdá' sleémeero naa baraá looháy wa waatl adoorí kari ya/án. Kaahamusmo Esra hhawaate giri paraátl baraá tla/ángw geeraharuusér uren ar tlahhi'i wa alé, nee umer'ín gari gooín. Tana iwiít bál slahhángw mibaangw tawa wak as kaangwí kuwa alqayti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kángw hhawaate sleémeero kudá' /ameenár xoordaá hatlá' ngaa duxuutiye' kuri tsaát bál slahhángw geera tawa wak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá tla/ángw kaahamuusér Munguhe awa /ameenár xoordaá hatlá' nga duxuutiye' a kuká': Hhay Yeshua garmoó Yehosadaki nee hhaeewós, Ma'aseya, nee Elieseri, nee Yaribu, nee Gedalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín nina ya/ané' /ameenadá' kawa guusi nee as adoodá' tawa dakuús, gwaanda nguri duuxiyé' as dakuúsar'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhay Imeri a tí: Hanani, nee Sebadia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hhay Harimu a tí: Ma'aseya, nee Eliya, nee Shemaya, nee Yehieli, nee Usia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hhay Pashuri a tí: Eliehoenai nee Ma'aseya, nee Ishmaeli nee Netaneli, nee Yosabadi nee Elasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hhay Laáwi a tí: Yosabadi nee Shimei, nee Kelaya (inós an kudá' ta bay, Kelita) nee Petahia, nee Yuda, nee Elieseri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee awa daauuse a kuká': Eliashibu. Nee awa xuumuusér Doó Mungú a kuká': Shalumu, nee Telemu, nee Uri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee múk hatlá' oo Israeli, hhay Paroshi a ti: Ramia, nee Isia, nee Malkiya, nee Miyamini, nee Eleasari, nee Malkiya, nee Benaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
