          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhawaateeká' sleémeero /ameenár xoordaá hatlá' ngina duxuutiyé'. Inooín /ameenadá' kari guús nee na/ii'ín kudá' na laqwaalii'i.",
          "type": "text",
